  "body": "Private viewings by appointment only. Exceptional buying in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods!\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to secure a quality investment, enter the sought-after Bays market, or plan your next move into this fantastic location, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n- Freehold title with no body corporate fees\r\n- North-facing living with excellent natural light\r\n- Modern home with a touch of character\r\n- Fully fenced, ideal for children and pets\r\n- Private courtyard and elevated outdoor decking\r\n- Modern kitchen with dedicated dining nook\r\n- Heat pump, LED lighting and mains pressure continuous gas hot water\r\n- Just minutes from Kohimarama Beach and Mission Bay Beach\r\n- Healthy Homes compliant\r\n- Fixed-term tenancy in place, providing immediate rental income for investors\r\n\r\nCoastal Living, Everyday Convenience\r\n\r\nTucked away along a leafy Mission Bay address, this inviting home offers an appealing combination of comfort, privacy and easy-care living.\r\n\r\nSun-filled, north-facing interiors create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, while the seamless connection to the outdoor spaces makes entertaining, relaxing or simply enjoying a quiet afternoon effortless.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen, dedicated dining nook and thoughtfully updated interiors deliver everyday practicality without compromising on character. With recent improvements already completed, there's plenty to appreciate.\r\n\r\nA Location That Never Goes Out of Style\r\n\r\nEnjoy morning walks along Tamaki Drive, weekend swims at Kohimarama, coffee at Mission Bay's waterfront cafes and everything that makes this coastal neighbourhood so special.\r\n\r\nFor investors, the existing fixed-term tenancy offers immediate income, Healthy Homes compliance and the benefits of freehold ownership without body corporate fees.\r\n\r\nFor future homeowners, this is a chance to secure your place in a highly regarded coastal location, with the potential to make it your own once the tenancy arrangements allow.\r\n\r\nFreehold ownership. Northern sun. Private outdoor living. A premium coastal address.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this deserve your attention, particularly when value is the priority.\r\n\r\nIGNORE THE CV. COME AND SEE THE OPPORTUNITY!\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings by appointment only.\r\n\r\nAgents: Bring your buyers. Conjunctional sales welcomed from day one.\r\n\r\nDownload the property documents here: https://www.agentsend.com/WOX7\r\n\r\nhttps://www.diego.nz/99a-selwynavenue",
